{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09713","headline":"优鉢罗花歌 · 岑参","name":"优鉢罗花歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白山南，赤山北，其间有花人不识。\n绿茎碧叶好颜色，叶六瓣，花九房，夜掩朝开多异香，何不生彼中国兮生西方？移根在庭，媚我公堂，耻与衆草之爲伍，何亭亭而独芳？何不爲人之所赏兮？深山穷谷委严霜。\n吾窃悲阳关道路长，曾不得献于君王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}